{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Z] = Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Arrow Keys] = Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>INFO:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Intergalactic Hyperdimensional Cheerleading Championship (IHCC)! It's a competition, so aim for the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CHEER SQUAD</i></strong> is a simple, top-down, vertically scrolling, manic shooter where you shoot down wave after endless wave of superpowered cheerleaders while gracefully maneuvering through an onslaught of pom-pom bullets! The easy-to-learn scoring system makes this shoot 'em up ideal for playing in short, action-packed bursts. Like the arcade classics of old, the game is short, sweet, and to the point, with no downtime during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is Chamber Software's first publicly released video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for playing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638430?t=1743806219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638430/b736b50c1be6feb22292cb20476b146e0d8e9136/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743806219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638430/56932bd4126dfbaba12817bd7397cab3dbea33cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743806219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638430/56932bd4126dfbaba12817bd7397cab3dbea33cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743806219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CONTROLS:</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Z] = Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Arrow Keys] = Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>INFO:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Intergalactic Hyperdimensional Cheerleading Championship (IHCC)! It's a competition, so aim for the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>CHEER SQUAD</i></strong> is a simple, top-down, vertically scrolling, manic shooter where you shoot down wave after endless wave of superpowered cheerleaders while gracefully maneuvering through an onslaught of pom-pom bullets! The easy-to-learn scoring system makes this shoot 'em up ideal for playing in short, action-packed bursts. Like the arcade classics of old, the game is short, sweet, and to the point, with no downtime during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is Chamber Software's first publicly released video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for playing.</p>","developers":["Chamber Software L.L.C."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638430/dc7afe4ee34da9cd470f4e31e8b030287887e788/header.jpg?t=1743806219","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2017-2025 Chamber Software. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121589,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121589/movie480.mp4?t=1743806013","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121589/movie_max.mp4?t=1743806013"},"name":"CHEER SQUAD | 90 Seconds","thumbnail